# Atlas Core: Component Token Architecture & Harmonic UX Spec
**Author:** Kilo Van Dyk  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D12 02:45  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Component design token specification for Project Atlas Core, defining atomic radii, elevation, motion, and semantic color channels rooted in human-centered SaaS and Face-to-Face harmony.

